<section class="inchy-shell inchy-section inchy-chapter inchy-origin-feature" id="origin">
  <span class="inchy-chapter__number" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
  <header class="inchy-chapter-heading">
    <p class="inchy-kicker">A SMALL SEED. A WORLD OF POSSIBILITY.</p>
    <h2 class="inchy-section-title">ROOTED IN BIODIVERSITY</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="inchy-origin-feature__visual">
    {% if section.settings.image != blank %}
      {{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 2000 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '600, 1000, 1500, 2000', alt: section.settings.image.alt }}
    {% else %}
      <img src="{{ 'inchy-origin-green.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1400" height="788" loading="lazy" alt="Botanical visualization of sacha inchi fruit among lush green leaves">
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  <div class="inchy-origin-feature__story">
    <h3>ONE<br>REMARKABLE<br>SEED.</h3>
    <div>
      <p>Heart-shaped leaves. A star-shaped fruit. Within it, a seed with a 3,000-year history of use. A story that began long before INCHY.</p>
      <p><em>Plukenetia volubilis</em>, known as sacha inchi, belongs to tropical South America. Today, our story begins with farmers in Colombia—and the care they bring to every harvest.</p>
      <p>Premium, high-quality sacha inchi was difficult to source. That’s why we helped establish a growers association, united by a shared commitment to quality.</p>
      <p>Nature gives us the starting point. Through our proprietary process, developed over years, we give it a new form: INCHY FORM1, with protein and fiber together.</p>
      <a class="inchy-text-link" href="{{ routes.root_url }}?view=process">EXPLORE OUR PROCESS →</a>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "INCHY origin",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Grower, crop or origin image", "info": "Use your own crop or grower photograph when available. The green botanical visualization appears until an image is selected." },
    { "type": "url", "id": "origin_link", "label": "Origin page link" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "INCHY origin" }]
}
{% endschema %}
